er parker from  the main marvel universe met miles  morales and said i give you my blessing  of spider-man that tom holland fully  becoming spider-man comes by way of him  meeting toby maguire and andrew garfield  and between them it's all kind of like  yeah man you're as much as spider-man as  we are be your own guy do your own thing  be your own hero and that solidifies tom  holland as the spider-man that we know  and love going forward into the future  of the mcu or if that doesn't happen in  the rebooted sony verse featuring those  spider-man films so with all that out of  the way and as mentioned previously  i am looking to expand and i'm hiring  people here at geek culture explained  and also what comics explain i'm  actually hiring for a few positions two  positions really the first one is for an  anime  manga podcast so if you live in the  northern colorado area so like fort  collins longmont greely then check out  the link in the description which will  send you to the application form for the  anime manga podcast here at geek culture  explained now if you don't live in  northern colorado that position is not  for you  but the position that congress explained  might be so i'm looking for a writer  researcher for comments explained  podcast so if that's interesting to you  make sure you check in the link in the  description for that application make  sure you fill them out and that's all  you have to do just hit send when you're  done and they'll automatically be sent  to me i will comb through them and if  i'm interested in bringing you on then  we'll go further from there i'll talk  about the pay and all that kind of good  stuff so you kind of know what you're  getting into so with that being said  guys hopefully i hear from you thank you  all for watching and i will catch you  all later  peace
 

